  "verdict": "allowed",
  "section": "34",
  "quote": "The tenant is responsible for the repair of undue damage to the rental unit or residential complex caused by the wilful or negligent conduct of the tenant, another occupant of the rental unit or a person permitted in the rental unit or residential complex by the tenant.",
  "reason": "Section 34 expressly holds tenants responsible for repairing undue damage caused wilfully or negligently by the tenant, an occupant, or their guests. As the clause reflects this statutory obligation, it is valid and enforceable."
}

